msgid "TracksCompute"
msgstr ""

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.TracksCompute.TracksCompute:1
msgid "Classe contenant les paramètres de Calcul sur les trajectoires :"
msgstr "Class containing tracks computes settings:"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.TracksCompute.TracksCompute:3
msgid "Attributs :"
msgstr "Attributes:"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.TracksCompute.TracksCompute:4
msgid "**MSD** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`) : Calcul du MSD par trajectoire et par plans successifs (par défaut : `False`)."
msgstr "**MSD** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`): Calculate MSD per track and per successive plane (default: `False`)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.TracksCompute.TracksCompute:6
msgid "**Instant Diffusion** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`) : Calcul de la diffusion instantanée par trajectoire et par plans successifs (par défaut : `False`)."
msgstr "**Instant Diffusion** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox. CheckBox>`): Calculation of instantaneous diffusion per track and per successive planes (default: `False`)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.TracksCompute.TracksCompute:8
msgid "**Fit Length** (:class:`SpinInt <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt>`) : Longueur de la fenêtre de calcul initiale des métriques génériques (par défaut : `4`)."
msgstr "**Fit Length** (:class:`SpinInt <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt>`): Length of the initial calculation window for generic metrics (default: `4`)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.TracksCompute.TracksCompute:10
msgid "**3D** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`) : Utilisation ou non de la coordonnée Z dans les calculs (par défaut : `False`)."
msgstr "**3D** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`): Whether or not to use the Z coordinate in calculations (default: `False`)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.TracksCompute.TracksCompute:12
msgid "**Log Scale** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`) : Utilisation ou non d'une échelle logarithmique pour les résultats (par défaut : `False`)."
msgstr "**Log Scale** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer. Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`): Whether to use a logarithmic scale for the results (default: `False`)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.TracksCompute.TracksCompute:14
msgid "**Fit** (:class:`Combo <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo>`) : Méthode d'ajustement du mouvement de la trajectoire (par défaut : `None`)."
msgstr "**Fit** (:class:`Combo <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo>`): Method for fitting the track movement (default: `None`)."

